WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.381
Explain how rules and responsible institutions support law and order.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.110
Communities use rules and laws to protect people and property. Police and other

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.020
justice institutions have responsibilities for public safety and the fair use of the

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:15.397
law.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.724
Lawyers help people understand and use legal processes. Citizens should obey fair

00:00:21.724 --> 00:00:24.947
rules, avoid violence and report danger appropriately.

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:29.517
Role-play a safe community problem and identify who should help.
